# The documented read-only set (docs/common.md "Read-only filesystems",
# Docker example; same set as the read-only-filesystem scenario): root
# filesystem read-only, runtime directories as tmpfs, the work directory as
# the one writable mount (anonymous tmpfs starts empty — the documented
# tmpfs/emptyDir case).
--read-only
--tmpfs /run
--tmpfs /tmp
--tmpfs /var/lib/nginx
--tmpfs /var/log/nginx
--tmpfs /container/work
